# The font of the check's text, about 3.4 mm high on any display: read by main/CMakeLists.txt (dgx_font_needs_file)
# and by the Makefile (dgx_fonts.py build of DGX). The board's pixels and millimetres are given apart, by its file's
# choice in CMake and on the command line with make. The letters of the check and of the boards' names.
need check
size 3.4mm
postscript DejaVuSans
text touch_check.c
text board_jc4827w543.c
text board_computer.c
letters 0123456789
